            <div xml:id="d911">

                <pb facs="0940" n="928" xml:id="pg928"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.52/201: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Weddell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-10-03T00:00:00-05:00">October 3,
                            1941—midnight</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>538. Your 874, October 1, 8 p.m. It is suggested that the opening words of
                    paragraph 3 be modified to read as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Moreover my government has continued to supply Spain with petroleum
                            products and other urgently needed products despite the fact that the
                            Spanish Government has excluded” et cetera.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
